WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.403
Blend sounds in order to read a word; use letter-sound links to spell it.

00:00:05.283 --> 00:00:08.483
Which pair uses the same digraph? Answer: shop and shell

00:00:09.283 --> 00:00:12.739
Blend three new words aloud, then write and check their spelling.

00:00:13.617 --> 00:00:16.539
Discuss why: Both shop and shell start with sh.
